run_project3_pipeline.py
Complete self-contained pipeline for Project 3 (dft-photocatalysis).

Executes:
1. Environment & Package Structure Setup
2. Fetches/Generates 519-Record Experimental Benchmark Dataset
3. Generates 3D Quantum Atomic Structure Models
